<title>JAPAN: Dlr higher, but morning gains trimmed by late Tokyo.</title>
<headline>Dlr higher, but morning gains trimmed by late Tokyo.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>0624 GMT     2400 GMT	NYK CLOSE</p>
<p> USD/JPY	   118.83/93    118.48/52     118.55/65</p>
<p> USD/DEM	   1.7013/23    1.6958/62     1.6930/40</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>The dollar stood higher against the yen by late Wednesday, but bigger gains were pared after a Japanese trust bank denied rumours about forex losses, and due to concerns about a rise in Japan's long-term interest rates.</p>
<p>Huge selling pressure above 119 yen on speculation that the Japanese government may not want the dollar to go above 120 yen weighed on the dollar, dealers said.</p>
</text>
